{:schema :wm/action-scales-v1
 ;; Operator-curated action-cost scales (shape (a) of
 ;; M-action-cost-modelling §INSTANTIATE scope-in: "source from
 ;; operator-curated EDN").  Keyed by candidate-action :target string;
 ;; values are one of :minute :hour :session :multi-session :mission
 ;; :campaign.
 ;;
 ;; Curated entries carry evidence in their rationale; a target with no
 ;; entry here falls back to action-scale/default-scale-for (typed by
 ;; action :type, :scale-source :default) so EVERY candidate carries a
 ;; scale while curated rows remain distinguishable from defaults.
 :scales {"sorry/wm-ui-hud-mode-rationale-hardcode"
          {:scale :minute
           :rationale "Tooltip text swap sourced from strategic-vocabulary; M-action-cost-modelling names this the :minute-scale member of the tied-sorries test case."}
          "sorry/r3d-per-entity-attribution"
          {:scale :campaign
           :rationale "Blocked on M-INC step (b) typed-event-vocabulary before per-entity streams exist; mission text types it :campaign with re-typing to :mission once the shared predecessor lands."}}}
